  "worked_solution": "Using the sum and constant multiple rules, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\frac{1}{2}u(x)+3v(x))=\\frac{1}{2}{u}^{\u2032}(x)+3{v}^{\u2032}(x).\n$$\n\nAt the point where $x=4$, this gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\frac{1}{2}u(x)+3v(x))|}_{x=4} & =\\frac{1}{2}{u}^{\u2032}(4)+3{v}^{\u2032}(4) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(6)+3(2) \\\\  & =3+6 \\\\  & =9.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
